design: zoom icon ~7% so artwork fills more of the frame

Cropped branding/icon-source.png and public/og-image.png by 7% on each
side (2048x2048 -> 1762x1762), tightening the gold border around the
MU + neuron + syringe + wordmark. Regenerated favicon-16/32/48,
apple-touch-icon, icon-192, icon-512 from the cropped source.

Bumped cache-bust query string v=3 -> v=4 so iOS / link-preview caches
refetch the new tighter icons.

